{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/bountyAIhunter/status/2106783910071795846","id":"2106783910071795846","text":"My agent's router was writing 100+ tokens of JSON to say one word: \"billing\".\n\nllama.cpp just added decision models. They don't generate anything. One forward pass, you get probabilities for the options you gave it. The usage field literally says output_tokens: 0.\n\nSo I swapped my router. Before: Qwen3.5-9B generating JSON. After: Kev-4B on my 3070 (8GB).\n\n200 real routing calls from my own agent logs:\nsame decision as the old router: 183 / 200\ntime per decision, old router: ~1.9s\ntime per decision, Kev-4B Q8_0: 29ms\nvendor number on an RTX PRO 6000: 12ms\n\nThe useful part is the 17 it disagreed on. 14 of them came back with confidence under 0.5. So the rule is easy: under 0.5, send it to the big model. Everything else never touches it.\n\nFiles:\nQ4_K_M 3.03GB\nQ8_0 4.48GB\nBF16 8.43GB (doesn't fit 8GB)\n\nOne thing I didn't expect: Q4 vs Q8 changed 11 of the 200 answers. Quant hurts probabilities more than it hurts prose. If you route on a threshold, use Q8.\n\nSetup is one line:\nllama serve -hf ggml-org/Kev-4B-GGUF:Q8_0\nthen POST to /v1/systemone with your options.","raw_text":{"text":"My agent's router was writing 100+ tokens of JSON to say one word: \"billing\".\n\nllama.cpp just added decision models. They don't generate anything. One forward pass, you get probabilities for the options you gave it. The usage field literally says output_tokens: 0.\n\nSo I swapped my router. Before: Qwen3.5-9B generating JSON. After: Kev-4B on my 3070 (8GB).\n\n200 real routing calls from my own agent logs:\nsame decision as the old router: 183 / 200\ntime per decision, old router: ~1.9s\ntime per decision, Kev-4B Q8_0: 29ms\nvendor number on an RTX PRO 6000: 12ms\n\nThe useful part is the 17 it disagreed on. 14 of them came back with confidence under 0.5. So the rule is easy: under 0.5, send it to the big model. Everything else never touches it.\n\nFiles:\nQ4_K_M 3.03GB\nQ8_0 4.48GB\nBF16 8.43GB (doesn't fit 8GB)\n\nOne thing I didn't expect: Q4 vs Q8 changed 11 of the 200 answers. Quant hurts probabilities more than it hurts prose. If you route on a threshold, use Q8.\n\nSetup is one line:\nllama serve -hf ggml-org/Kev-4B-GGUF:Q8_0\nthen POST to /v1/systemone with your options.","display_text_range":[0,1074],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[279,302],"id":"2106454436386086912","display":"pic.x.com/lCmym86de9","original":"https://t.co/lCmym86de9","replacement":"https://x.com/bountyAIhunter/status/2106783910071795846/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"bountyAIhunter","url":"https://x.com/bountyAIhunter","id":"2068681864542384130","followers":411,"following":61,"likes":1543,"media_count":121,"name":"Bounty","description":"Human intuition. AI execution.","raw_description":{"text":"Human intuition. AI execution.","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2068681864542384130/1785337560","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2082482773625831424/nThNw_eR_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Jun 21 13:08:31 +0000 2026","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":2,"retweets":0,"likes":1,"bookmarks":1,"quotes":0,"created_at":"Sun Oct 04 16:30:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791131400,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":243,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"media":{"all":[{"id":"2106454436386086912","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2106454436386086912/vid/avc1/1920x1080/b3vE2ydnxsiS7dNp.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2106454436386086912/img/pK1RUnxEViHj_b8y.jpg","duration":60.7,"width":1920,"height":1080,"format":"video/mp4","type":"video","formats":[{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2106454436386086912/pl/OJ6krvsXRhFlpnwu.m3u8?tag=29"